<h1>A whole song from a single number.</h1>
<p class="lead">
	PanoramicData.MusicGeneration turns a <strong>seed</strong> into music: a key, a tempo, a chord every bar, a bass line, a tune and a drum pattern,
	rendered to sound. Give it the same seed tomorrow, on any machine, and you get the same song, sample for sample. Along with the sound it returns the
	<strong>list of notes it played</strong>, so you can compare what was written with what an analyser hears.
</p>

